# RunPod inventory

## Gate

Use when the user authorized RunPod work and the turn needs **read**
inventory: pods, endpoints, templates, GPU/CPU types, network volumes,
billing, capacity, hub repos, or registry auth metadata. Skip bare "GPU
cloud" talk without RunPod. Load `runpod-safety` on every RunPod turn; load
`runpod-mutate` only when the user also authorized create/start/stop/delete.
Out of scope: other GPU clouds and local CUDA debugging.

## Prefer MCP

Namespace: `user-mcp_runpod`. Do not invent tool names or resource ids.
List/resolve this turn before referencing a pod, endpoint, template, volume,
or job.

